{"uid":"78d05839530c6ec0","name":"test_early_plugin_sys_path_injection_ahead_of_cwd_still_resolves_here","fullName":"tests.test_tests_conftest_resolution#test_early_plugin_sys_path_injection_ahead_of_cwd_still_resolves_here","historyId":"9c98b754c0c809f9f7418bbfcc641648","time":{"start":1791867404941,"stop":1791867406777,"duration":1836},"description":"Model a pytest plugin that runs *before* any conftest.py is loaded\n    and pushes its own directory onto `sys.path[0]` -- ahead of the\n    working directory itself, not merely ahead of it on `PYTHONPATH`. This\n    is the harder *ordering*: `/conftest.py` must run after the plugin and\n    still win (a plain prepend would leave the plugin's earlier entry\n    still ahead if it also inserted at index 0). Since #64 the pre-bind\n    settles it outright, and the ordering no longer matters -- kept as the\n    regression guard for the ordering bug #50 was filed about.\n\n    Confirmed by mutation: deleting `/conftest.py` makes this fail on\n    resolution (the decoy's `tests/conftest.py` wins), which is the\n    original #50 symptom.\n    ","descriptionHtml":"<p>Model a pytest plugin that runs <em>before</em> any conftest.py is loaded<br />\nand pushes its own directory onto <code>sys.path[0]</code> -- ahead of the<br />\nworking directory itself, not merely ahead of it on <code>PYTHONPATH</code>. This<br />\nis the harder <em>ordering</em>: <code>/conftest.py</code> must run after the plugin and<br />\nstill win (a plain prepend would leave the plugin's earlier entry<br />\nstill ahead if it also inserted at index 0). Since #64 the pre-bind<br />\nsettles it outright, and the ordering no longer matters -- kept as the<br />\nregression guard for the ordering bug #50 was filed about.</p>\n<pre><code>Confirmed by mutation: deleting `/conftest.py` makes this fail on\nresolution (the decoy's `tests/conftest.py` wins), which is the\noriginal #50 symptom.\n</code></pre>\n","status":"passed","flaky":false,"newFailed":false,"new